{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 2, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "公", "id": "公"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "右", "id": "右"}, {"form": "司", "id": "司"}, {"form": "左", "id": "左"}, {"form": "日", "id": "日"}, {"form": "殘", "id": "殘"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "舍", "id": "舍"}, {"form": "賊", "id": "賊"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.826655943510057, "source": "公", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 2.161679639916808, "source": "上", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 0.7753852787969173, "source": "上", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 2.672505263682799, "source": "上", "target": "殘"}, {"weight": 1.1118575154181303, "source": "下", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 1.622683139184121, "source": "下", "target": "殘"}, {"weight": 2.2512917986064953, "source": "賢", "target": "右"}, {"weight": 2.2512917986064953, "source": "賢", "target": "左"}, {"weight": 2.2512917986064953, "source": "賢", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 1.8458266904983307, "source": "賢", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 2.9444389791664403, "source": "賢", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.3158303197440664, "source": "反", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 4.330733340286331, "source": "右", "target": "左"}, {"weight": 2.826655943510057, "source": "日", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 3.5198031240700023, "source": "日", "target": "司"}, {"weight": 3.9252682321781664, "source": "殘", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 4.212950304629947, "source": "殘", "target": "賊"}, {"weight": 2.826655943510057, "source": "司", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 2.826655943510057, "source": 